 "notes": "No ble/ package and no CmdBuilder; commands are inline 20-byte frames sent by GMessageSingleReadWrite (local GATT or ptReal). All five SKUs are ble+iot; 306/317/321 add Matter commissioning. State is written by opcodes 0x17/0x19/0x16/0x25 rather than JSON fields. Exact chart byte offsets and SharedKey bit packing are in base classes / obfuscated code (see md gaps).",
